        en: "FitMesh is building a native integration that reads your Huawei health and fitness data directly from the Huawei Health Kit cloud. This means it works on any Android device, with no Health Connect required. When the integration goes live, FitMesh will pull your data straight from Huawei's cloud and surface it in your unified dashboard. Data types covered in the planned integration: steps, sleep, heart rate, SpO2, calories.",
